Package: spectra2rgb
Type: Package
Title: Convert Spectral Signatures to sRGB and CIELAB Colour Coordinates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jhohan", "Elguera", email = "jelguerat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts hyperspectral reflectance signatures to device-
    independent sRGB hex codes and CIE L*a*b* coordinates using the
    CIE 1931 2-degree standard observer and the D65 standard illuminant.
    Includes bundled reference data so the package is self-contained.
    Handles missing and non-finite reflectance values via a configurable
    policy.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: stats, grDevices, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), readxl, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
